<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Luxottica cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Luxottica cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said Thursday it had cut its rating for Luxottica Group SpA to near-term neutral from near-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- The firm maintained its long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Luxottica shares closed at 64-3/4 on Wednesday. --Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
